  "title": "Peanut Butter and Jelly Stromboli",
  "description": "This sweet and savory stromboli with peanut butter and grape jelly is sliced into bite-size pinwheels both kids and adults will enjoy.",
  "authors": [
    "Jennica Reis"
  ],
